---
import Link from "../Link.astro";
import ProjectTemplate from "../ProjectTemplate.astro";
---

<ProjectTemplate
  title="Stock Data Generator"
  link="https://github.com/michaelzhan1/stock-data-generator"
>
  <p>
    This was inspired by an interview question from a friend's team: given a
    stream of stock data, design a system to query the max price in a recent
    time range. I thought it would be fun to build a simple version of this and
    visualize it. The Go backend simulates stock data with geometric brownian
    motion and serves it to the frontend through SSE. The frontend uses a
    sliding-window max algorithm to track the min and max prices in real time,
    with <Link href="https://github.com/ChartGPU/ChartGPU" content="ChartGPU" /> for
    visualization.
  </p>
</ProjectTemplate>
